      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "mms_varcoeff_periodic_decay",
          "description": "Manufactured solution u(x,t) = exp(-4 pi^2 t) cos(2 pi x) for u_t = div(k(x) grad u) + S(x,t) with k(x) = 1 + 0.5 cos(2 pi x). Derivation: u_t = -4 pi^2 u; div(k grad u) = exp(-4 pi^2 t)[-2 pi^2 cos(4 pi x) - 4 pi^2 cos(2 pi x)] with k'(x) = -pi sin(2 pi x); the forcing S = u_t - div(k grad u) collapses (product-to-sum) to exp(-4 pi^2 t) * 2 pi^2 cos(4 pi x), matching the rhs term above, so u solves the continuous PDE exactly. cos(2 pi x) is the fundamental periodic mode on [0,1], compatible with the periodic rule; no boundary error is introduced. References evaluate at cell centers x_i = (i - 1/2)/N, spelled inline per esm-spec 6.6.5 (build-time evaluation folds literals and the metaparameter N only). The t=0 assertion pins the ic wiring (reference equals the initial field); the t=0.1 assertion bounds the relative L2 discretization error, which falls at the conservative-FV order 2. Exact per-resolution error values are pinned in tests/conformance/convergence/heat_1d_varcoeff_periodic/golden/errors.json.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.1
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 1e-09
              },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "cos",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      6.283185307179586,
                      {
                        "op": "aggregate",
                        "output_idx": [
                          "i"
                        ],
                        "args": [],
                        "ranges": {
                          "i": {
                            "from": "x"
                          }
                        },
                        "expr": {
                          "op": "+",
                          "args": [
                            0,
                            {
                              "op": "*",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "-",
                                  "args": [
                                    "i",
                                    0.5
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "/",
                                  "args": [
                                    1,
                                    "N"
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.1,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 0.01
              },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  {
